Description: graphite and matte blue-grey theme for Xfce
 Ceratopsian provides GTK 2, 3 and 4 styling, Xfwm window decorations,
 notifications, icons, dark and light pointer themes, and a terminal palette.
 .
 The package also includes the Debian 13 Matte and Clean wallpapers and
 optional GRUB, Plymouth and Qt integration files.
